227
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,200
Second Celestial Guard,

228
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,410
go !

229
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:47,080
Ling Tianhou's sword energy !

230
00:16:49,790 --> 00:16:50,810
Go !

