260
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:20,200
Then, I'll refine this Moongazer Serpent's bone.

261
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:23,490
The completion of the Heaven Defying Bead

262
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:26,080
